# memory 5
mark memory_5
click observe Myself
wait for 0.3
hold 2
choose childhood_reminescence
advance 12 900
cursor rest
hold 6
click think last
wait for 0.3
hold 2
choose childhood_reminescence
advance 12 900
cursor rest
