clip end childhood

# ── Getting up: "Myself" holds the states of exhaustion; the scenery answers too ────────────────────
mark get_up
clip get_up
advance 12 900
cursor rest
hold 8
click observe Myself
wait for 0.3
hold 2
choose childhood_memory
advance 12 900
cursor rest
hold 6
click think last
wait for 0.3
hold 2
choose 0
advance 12 900
cursor rest
hold 6
click act 0
wait for 0.3
hold 2
choose 0
advance 12 900
dice
hold 2
click humor hepar needed
click die needed
click humor spleen needed
click die needed
hold 2
click continue
advance 20 900
cursor rest
hold 8
click continue
wait mode WorldView 900
cursor rest
hold 6
clip end get_up
state
quit
